AXPROCS=1 and 2 at `-race -count=20` passed.\n  - 9 weakenings each went red, then were restored. The list is in the earlier report and the PR body.\n  \n  **CI**\n  - Green (21): build ×3, lint, CodeQL, Analyze ×4, test windows vet and compile-and-plan, all guards, statusline ×2, prompt-context-hook ×2.\n  - Failed: 0.\n  - Running (12): test macos, test ubuntu, test windows (8 shards plus non-heavy packages), Entire Gates.\n  \n  **Still open**\n  - The test suites have not finished. Check with `gh pr checks 373 --repo entireio/entire-graph`. If many unrelated tests fail at once, grep the logs for `DATA RACE` first.\n  - No Entire Gates findings yet.\n</agent-message>","reason":"absorbed_mid_turn","commandUuid":"54c95102-be9a-4a36-8ec3-25085d6ca3b2","deliveryId":"b54f904b-4134-4a05-b32a-b6ef4d94db7c"}
