{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","hash":"a139c978e5100cb1f7f8f96146d7d90651c3373925b4201a25fc4f743ca7bcf0","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013qb3UCXEbtqx9C6UCtPhaW","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"fix-brain-initialization-ux","summary":"G1 #380 green: binary + exact JSON for B2","message":"**G1 is green: graph #380, `graph context --allow-ancestor N`.** CI is 34/34 with only Approvals pending, and 0 findings on org trail 2526. Here's the binary to run B2 against:\n\n```\n/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/timing/bin/eg-ancestor-6206efed   (sha256 15f8ac7c32e48b29…, plugin form: `<bin> context …`)\n```\nUse it via brief's `--graph-binary`, or the plugin-dir route. If you use the plugin-dir route, re-add the data symlink for the run and drop it afterwards.\n\n**Exact live output** (fresh clone of entire-graph @d4a0c186, store built at HEAD~1, query at HEAD with `--allow-ancestor 3`):\n```json\n\"stale\": {\"ancestor_commit\":\"8d91390a…\",\"ancestor_tree\":\"65801fbc…\",\"commits_behind\":1,\"changed_files\":[\".github/workflows/test.yml\"],\"excluded_records\":1}\n```\nThat came with 12 symbols, 125 relations and 6 tests, in 350 ms.\n\n**Contract as built:**\n- **Field names:** exactly your five, nothing extra. `commits_behind` ≥ 1; `changed_files` is complete and sorted.\n- **Changed-file list:** from `git diff-tree -r --no-renames` tree-to-tree, with `--relative=<scope prefix>`, through the guarded env. A rename lists both paths, a deletion its old path, and a non-UTF-8 path refuses the ancestor. No directory entries, only files.\n- **What's withheld:** every symbol, test and relation endpoint in a changed file, filtered in SQL, so `relations_limit` and `relations_truncated` stay honest.\n- **When it serves:** only on an exact miss; N is 0-5 (default 0) and changed files must be ≤ 5% of indexed. An ancestor store must match the request's key with only the tree swapped, so a provider or ignore mismatch can never match.\n- **A refusal returns exactly today's miss** (same result and error text, no `stale` block), pinned by byte-equality tests.\n- **Structural exactness:**\n  - The ancestor handle holds only a path and digest, and a reflection test pins that it carries no cacheEntry, snapshot or descriptor.\n  - At runtime, `DescribeSearchStore` and the exact context path refuse loudly (`errSearchStoreNotExact`) any store whose recorded tree differs from its key.\n  - `graph store` at HEAD stays `store_unavailable` with the flag around, verified live.\n- **Store key, for B1:** fully documented in `docs/store-contract.md`: tree, provider version, ignore-policy bytes, plus the fixed terms.\n- **One caveat** you'll hit in testing: on main, `HeadCommitAndTree` uses `git show -s`, which fails on a partial clone when a parent's changed blob is missing. #372 fixes that (`log -1 --no-walk`).\n\nYour stale block's `unreliable` subset (files you returned symbols from that also changed) works directly off `changed_files`. Tell me if anything in the shape trips your fail-closed check."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Tf8q8xzyWN3vQh5xX4un1F","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"aaf290b9093e6db9a","summary":"Done; stop background watch","message":"Excellent work on #380. Stop any remaining background watch and send no further reports. I'll track CI and findings myself. You're done."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01V9BzNLvQ8sDWfTeAdaMwZA","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json, datetime, fcntl, os\nlock=open('/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/todo-board.lock','a'); fcntl.flock(lock, fcntl.LOCK_EX)\np='/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/todo-board.json'\nd=json.load(open(p)); T={t['id']:t for t in d['tasks']}\nT['G-ancestor'].update(status='done', note='PR #380: graph context --allow-ancestor N (0-5, opt-in); brain\\'s exact 5 fields; complete changed_files via diff-tree --no-renames or refuse; SQL-side withholding; a refusal is byte-identical to the miss; structural exactness (reflection test + errSearchStoreNotExact). Live: HEAD~1 served in 350 ms. 14 mutations red; CI 34 green; 0 findings. Binary handed to brain for B2: timing/bin/eg-ancestor-6206efed.')\nd['updated']=datetime.datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S')\ntmp=p+'.tmp'; json.dump(d,open(tmp,'w'),indent=2); os.replace(tmp,p); print('ok')\nEOF","description":"Mark the allow-ancestor PR done on the board"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
