 |\n| 7 | #375 | Cache-hit history splice | warm def/neighbors/impact 0.62 → 0.44 s (fixes the regression) | no |\n| 8 | #372 | Index partial clones on Git ≥ 2.45.1 (no network egress) | cli/entiredb index offline; `query --head` cli 34 → 2.5 s. Three adversarial rounds: SAFE TO MERGE | CHANGELOG only |\n| 9 | #380 | `graph context --allow-ancestor N` + capability key | serves HEAD~1 in 350 ms with a typed stale block | CHANGELOG only |\n| 10 | #374 | Tool-handler heuristic reads identifiers only | false tool symbols 84 → 3; cache bump v22/v27 | CHANGELOG only |\n| 11 | #142 | Stop cleanly on cancellation; never cache a truncated snapshot | behaviour fix (time limit dropped) | **yes**: apply `142-x-374.patch`, `142-x-376.patch`, `142-x-378-allowlist.patch` |\n| 12 | #378 | Disclose unmodelled value refs + co-change failure warning; cache bump v23/v28 | silent gaps now warn | **yes**: `375-x-378.patch`, `142-x-378.patch`, `374-x-378-versions.patch`, plus CHANGELOG |\n\nPatches: `/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/eg-integration/.g3/resolutions/`. They are also embedded in #381's body.\n\n## Combined effect (cli repo, #381 vs main)\n- cold index 11.8 → 7.8 s (−34%)\n- first warm query 11.7 → 3.5 s (−70%)\n- warm def/neighbors/impact 0.62 → 0.44 s\n\n## Your decisions\n- **Approvals** on all 12. You cannot approve your own PRs, so a teammate is needed, or your override.\n- Whether to make the new `lazy-fetch git matrix` CI job (#372) a required check. It is path-filtered.\n- Close #381 after the merges. It exists only for CI.\n- Your two old drafts: #146 (RFD 0005) and #300 (semantic channel). Community #249 is probably superseded by #261.\n\n## Follow-ups noted, not done\n- `--no-renames` in co-change, so it works on blob:none clones.\n- A failing history refresh makes every warm query a cache miss.\n- A faster warm alias route, which would remove #377's +0.8 s.\n- Real C1 fix: Go var symbols plus a REFERENCES relation.\n- Python and TypeScript tool-registration detection.\n- Static launch-scan gaps: reflect, plugin, asm, computed syscalls.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8d1aa8ce-e5cc-4ee3-be7f-321f544c3824","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d626c0f7-c620-4bf9-87cc-97530824c763","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
