{"parentUuid":"bbbb0da7-df1a-41b7-b91e-a1ceae91b97d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNQmVkTzsG9wU215od8o","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Brain is final: all four findings are fixed and green, and the independent check of #489 confirmed the fix. That check surfaced a design decision for you rather than a bug, which I'll put in the handoff.\n\n**The #489 decision.** On a partial clone, with network fetches blocked, git can't tell \"this file is gone for good\" from \"this file just isn't downloaded yet\". #489 treats both as gone, so Brain could replace a bigger index with a smaller one and only warn. Both obvious guards are wrong:\n- \"refuse on any partial clone\" re-breaks cli, which is a partial clone;\n- \"refuse if the index shrinks\" breaks deliberate privacy exclusions, which shrink it on purpose.\n\nThe right guard has to know about privacy exclusions, so it's your design call. #489 is still a clear improvement on what it replaced.\n\nStarting the final check of agents actually using the graph, against the combined build of all 12 graph fixes:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1529,"cache_read_input_tokens":598696,"output_tokens":709,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":194},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1529,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":709,"cache_read_input_tokens":598696,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1529,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1529},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"con