ne path (default $H/repo-cli; must have no ancestor CLAUDE.md / .claude/CLAUDE.md)\n  spent_offset  dollars already spent by other configs sharing this budget\nPaid: every session is a real `claude -p` on the user's plan. Sessions run\nsequentially under nice -n 10 and `env -i`. ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is never set.\n\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport os\nimport re\nimport shutil\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\nimport time\nfrom datetime import datetime\nH = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\nPIN = \"3d1b73ff2a669a0df7afaca24f4c8d0cca1435e7\"\nREPO = os.path.join(H, \"repo-cli\")\nPLUGIN_DIR = os.path.join(H, \"plugins\")\nHOME = os.path.expanduser(\"~\")\nc_blast_radius - We are considering changing the signature of GetGitCommonDir in the strategy package so th\nf_explore_verbatim - Call the Agent tool exactly once with subagent_type \"Explore\" and with this prompt, copied\nd_subagent - Use a subagent (Agent tool) to investigate how per-session state files are read, written a\na_conceptual - How does the CLI keep secrets and personal data out of agent transcripts before they are s\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"029f6984-a6f7-4807-9899-094d7cd24142","timestamp":"2026-10-25T05:34:36.981Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"{\n  \"label\": \"final-5a0fc43d\",\n  \"binary\": \"/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/fresh-env/bin/entire-graph-final\",\n  \"repo\": \"/Users/Shared/fresh-env-repo-cli\",\n  \"tasks\": [\"c_blast_radius\", \"f_explore_verbatim\"],\n  \"budget_usd\": 1.6,\n  \"caps\": {\"c_blast_radius\": 0.8, \"f_explore_verbatim\": 0.6},\n  \"margin_usd\": 0.15,\n  \"min_cap_usd\": 0.4,\n  \"max_turns\": 40,\n  \"timeout_s\": 1800,\n  \"out\": \"/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/fresh-env/results-final.json\"\n}\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Fresh-environment graph-usage harness.\nQuestion: in a FRESH Claude Code environment with entire-graph installed the\nofficial way (entire plugin install + init-agents), do agents