{"parentUuid":"493d1940-211f-4372-bed2-835a8c09b5b3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNQujq27jPNtSU9HhsA7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The final adoption check is running on the combined build of all 12 graph fixes. It's four real Claude sessions in a clean environment, with a hard $2.60 cap:\n- **a blast-radius question:** what breaks if a function changes;\n- **one task handed to Claude's Explore helper agent:** the case that used to make zero graph calls;\n- **a helper-agent investigation;**\n- **a conceptual \"how does this work\" question.**\n\nFor each, it records whether the agent reaches for the graph first. I first updated the kit to install the way a user does today (`entire graph setup`).\n\nThe Brain side is final, and its own combined test is passing so far. When this check finishes, I'll put both halves into one handoff page for you."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1162,"cache_read_input_tokens":605705,"output_tokens":231,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1162,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":231,"cache_read_input_tokens":605705,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1162,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1162},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"bd99cf99-cf0c-45f7-b13e-b766162cc66e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgNQujVfsJk4dzeUosw14","requestRef":"28ae1e8c-d727-40d0-ba37-bc1dbd5a8487","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9991367e-c15b-4fe9-a15f-5427c7f2c1a5