{"parentUuid":"79d22c3b-99ca-42f8-8b40-fa0d69662a03","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"All 12 graph speed and correctness fixes are done as green PRs, and a fresh-environment check shows agents using the graph first. Next, once the Brain session confirms its final 13 PRs, I'll publish one combined merge-order page for you to approve. (disable recaps in /config)","timestamp":"2026-10-25T05:42:52.802Z","uuid":"79e37dc8-b5f3-4717-b9e3-8c43dfbcbdf3","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
