d w/ project scope + digest cache-key\n- [THE NUMBER is +8.6%](the-number-is-8-6-percent.md) — token savings, 3 runs/50 instances mean +8.56% sd 4.2pt; out-of-sample REP30F +7.16%\n- [rep50 35% exhaustively closed](rep50-35pct-exhaustively-closed.md) — every token lever quantified; fair ceiling +14.99%; 25/35% unreachab\n- [Route to 35% falsified](eg-route-to-35-falsified.md) — grep-shim caps at 38.9%; all routes sum to ~+15%\n- [Graph SWE-bench verdict](graph-swebench-verdict.md) — graph = token win (−19-23%), NOT accuracy lever; tests-first reverted\n- [Graph is slower in wall-clock](graph-is-slower-in-wallclock.md) — tokens +6.22% but 127.0h vs 117.7h (−7.9%); always quote time beside to\n- [Benchmark has no correctness headroom](benchmark-has-no-correctness-headroom.md) — baseline 30/30, eg 29/30; suite saturated\n- [Session length is the mechanism](session-length-is-the-mechanism.md) — r=0.947 msg-delta↔token-delta; TEN metrics dead = law\n- [Instance identity predicts NOTHING](instance-identity-predicts-nothing.md) — same instance twice r=−0.022, 100% run variance; fix CLASSES\n- [Harness building is the whole mechanism](harness-building-is-the-whole-mechanism.md) — repro harnesses: 79% gain/43% loss; verify, don't\n- [Harness pool is symmetric](harness-pool-is-symmetric.md) — 25% of every session, identical both arms; eg-only removal faked headlines; ce\n- [Graph is a 1:1 substitute](graph-is-a-1to1-substitute.md) — displaces 0.980 calls per call; 10% needs 3.281; all levers stacked = 6.9%\n- [Gating ceiling is 8.3%](gating-ceiling-is-8-3-percent.md) — perfect difficulty oracle +8.30%; no predictor exists\n- [Haiku is worse, not better](haiku-is-worse-not-better.md) — ratio 0.436 vs Opus 0.980; cheap-model hope closed\n- [Cost decomposition](cost-decomposition-closes-25pct.md) — cacheRead 48.9/output 32.9/cacheCreation 18.2% of cost; COST +5.21% not +7.16%\n- [The fair number is 2.5%](the-fair-number-is-2-5-percent.md) — HOLD50+REP30F n=75 COST +2.49% CI [−6.83,+11.18], median NEGATIVE; 25% outs\n- [Cross-cell comparison is confounded](cross-cell-comparison-is-confounded.md) — same config 26pt apart; only paired-on-identical-instances\n- [Selected extremes can't test regression](selected-extremes-cannot-test-regression.md) — RTM drops selected winners median 109pt; simulate\n- [Mechanism endpoint caught a false headline](mechanism-endpoint-caught-a-false-headline.md) — score AND mechanism rose = baseline drift; m\n- [Estimator flips the sign](estimator-flips-the-sign.md) — pooled +8.73% vs equal-weighted −3.02%; nine loss-tail predictors dead\n- [Per-loser forensics doctrine](per-loser-forensics-doctrine.md) — investigate each loser; fix the defect CLASS; re-verify winners\n- [Benchmark arm-fairness bugs](benchmark-arm-fairness-bugs.md) — audit the HARNESS before the tool; verify.run was eg-only in all 5 cells\n- [Load pressure is an arm confound](load-pressure-is-an-arm-confound.md) — starvation inflates whichever arm runs under it, flips sign; cap\n- [eg A/B cache trap](eg-ab-testing-cache-trap.md) — index cache tree-keyed not binary-keyed; separate --cache-dir per build\n- [eg nested worktrees kill cache](eg-nested-worktrees-kill-cache.md) — .claude/worktrees/* blows 64-path digest budget; ~5s per search unca\n- [Stale baseline contamination](stale-baseline-contamination.md) — Haiku/Sonnet baselines predate env-repair clamp; diff prompts line-by-li\n- [VERIFY command fails fairness](verify-command-fails-fairness.md) — runnable test command = arm-asymmetric HELP, not tool output; keep out\n- [claude --safe-mode strips MCP](claude-safe-mode-strips-mcp.md) — silently removes ALL MCP servers; only check = ask model its tools\n- [Usage is NOT the lever](usage-is-not-the-lever.md) — more graph calls = WORSE (corr −0.166); call count is a difficulty signal\n- [Agentic token saving is the clamp](agentic-token-saving-is-the-clamp.md) — CAUSAL: frugality prompt not graph; unclamped −25.8%→−0.9%\n- [Graph savings scale with ses