ntire-graph/pull/380\">#380</a></td><td>Answer from a recent commit, opt-in</td><td>Brain keeps code context between re-indexes</td><td class=\"note\">changelog only</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">10</td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/374\">#374</a></td><td>Tool detection reads names, not text</td><td>false tool symbols 84 → 3</td><td class=\"note\">changelog only</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">11</td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/142\">#142</a></td><td>Stop cleanly on cancel; never cache partial results</td><td>behaviour fix</td><td class=\"note\">apply 3 patches</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">12</td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/378\">#378</a></td><td>Say when references or history are missing</td><td>silent gaps now warn</td><td class=\"note\">apply 3 patches</td></tr></tbody>\n    </table></div>\n    <p class=\"note\">Combined on the cli repo: cold index 11.8 → 7.8 s, first warm query 11.7 → 3.5 s, warm lookups 0.62 → 0.44 s.</p>\n\n    <h2>Brain</h2>\n    <div class=\"tablewrap\"><table>\n      <thead><tr><th>PR</th><th>What</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/473\">#473</a></td><td>Attribute every daemon log line</td><td class=\"note\">apply pr473 patch (workspace move on main)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/474\">#474</a></td><td>One divergent cached transcript no longer refuses the run</td><td class=\"note\">—</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/476\">#476</a></td><td>Normalize history text once</td><td class=\"note\">history index −40%</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/477\">#477</a></td><td>Doctor proves the MCP tools are reachable</td><td class=\"note\">apply pr477 patch</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/478\">#478</a></td><td>Fact freshness 