 evening: ALL 25 PRs MERGED on the user's explicit \"merge\".** Neither repo requires approvals on GitHub\n(Entire Gates \"Approvals\" is reported, not enforced); brain main has enforce_admins + required benchmark-corpus /\nbrowser-smoke, so #484 needed its brainmark tests fixed first.\n- **Graph (I merged):** 370 a12fff59, 371 227f7a60, 377 daa06090 (retargeted), 373 1d1e8394, 379 fc71355e,\n  376 9bad2b4a, 375 57f280bf, 372 b8850d68, 380 ebf9a2fa, 374 e514be52, 142 1492feb9, 378 d0475ce8. Final main tree\n  8b0913a4 == #381 tip tree; #381 closed. Last four went in as a fast-forward CHAIN (each merges its predecessor +\n  saved resolution patch) → one CI cycle instead of four.\n- **#373 after #382:** keeps #382's FIFO pool, only lookahead 4→16 / buffers 8→2; −3.4..−9.5% (not −28..−35%).\n- **Brain (brain session merged):** all 13, main c4c4ae1c. Follow-up: open finding trail 390 on merged #481 code\n  (seed copies snapshot.Selected regardless of `covered`); fix PR in progress by brain session.\n- **Open for user:** cut a graph nightly from main; decisions list below still stands (minus approvals).\n\n(History below is the pre-merge state.)\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(head+'\\n---\\n'+new+body)\nEOF\nsed -i '' 's|^- \\[Semantic-layer handoff state\\](semantic-layer-handoff-state.md) — .*|- [Semantic-layer handoff state](semantic-layer-handoff-state.md) — 2026-10-25 ALL 25 MERGED (graph d0475ce8 == #381 tree; brain c4c4ae1c); follow-ups: trail-390 fix, graph nightly|' MEMORY.md; grep -c 'ALL 25 MERGED' MEMORY.md semantic-layer-handoff-state.md","description":"Mark merges done on the board and update the handoff memory"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1697,"cache_read_input_tokens":224228,"output_tokens":1702,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier"