{"parentUuid":"4c64207d-fd05-4a24-b469-45b4b9e7be01","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPT1iLdJ1knUutryoga7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 25 PRs are merged: 12 graph and 13 Brain. I'm waiting on the final CI run on graph main before calling it fully done.\n\n**Graph (I merged all 12)**\n- Merged in order, each with a merge commit. Graph main is now `d0475ce8`.\n- Before each merge, the PR's required checks passed, and a trail review on that exact commit had posted with 0 open findings.\n- The code on graph main is byte-identical to the fully tested combined branch #381, which I've now closed.\n- #380, #374, #142 and #378 conflicted with what had already landed. I applied the saved conflict fixes to their branches, re-ran CI on them, waited for fresh reviews, then merged.\n\n**Brain (the Brain session merged all 13)**\n- All 13 merged, with #484 last. I confirmed every one shows as merged. Brain main is `c4c4ae1c`.\n- **One follow-up:** a final review sweep found an open finding in code already merged from #481. The faster checkpoint-loading path can pre-load sessions that were meant to make Brain refuse an incomplete export. The Brain session is writing a fix as a new PR. It doesn't yet know whether any smaller export actually went out or whether the code just contradicts itself.\n\n**Correction on #373:** it ended up much smaller than first reported. A teammate's PR #382 had already sped up the same step, so on top of that #373 adds 3–10% faster cold indexing, not 28–35%. Output is unchanged.\n\n**What's left for you**\n- **Cut a new graph nightly or release from main.** Nobody gets the graph fixes until a release is built, including the Brain's new \"how stale is this\" note (#484), which needs #380. The installed graph is still the old version.\n- The other decisions are unchanged and listed on the page:\n  - build-then-swap;\n  - transcript mode;\n  - making the old-git CI job required;\n  - the 37 GB Brain store;\n  - the 63 `~/Documents/Coding` paths;\n  - the 3 `entire` CLI issues;\n  - the unreadable `cli` checkpoint;\n  - the Linear connector;\n  - your old drafts.\n- Run `/compact`.\n\nCI on Brain main was also still running when I last checked. Merge plan page: https://claude.ai/artifact/FkY6c5J1XdzaYGM1Q7T9dU"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":571,"cache_read_input_tokens":228480,"output_tokens":786,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":571,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":786,"cache_read_input_tokens":228480,"cache_creation_input_tokens":571,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":571},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b0a26917-fbad-482d-bae7-7f8ebf4d64ca","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPT1i2GZtwfo2zpbXwvf","requestRef":"ebc43769-6e17-4619-bea9-4ab738544ff6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"58523090-700e-497f-9301-324e73b7a537","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:44:13.400Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
