{"parentUuid":"b4f2cb38-f338-49d2-b332-bc8737d4e3a1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPToy5RyKtzCAj7BjxcX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Brain main has gone red since the merges, though none of our PRs broke on their own. A teammate (evisdren) merged his own PR #496 just after the last Brain merge. It renamed a helper function that one of #483's tests calls, so the two don't compile together. He has already opened a one-file fix, #497, and its checks are passing so far.\n\nThe Brain session and I agreed to leave #497 for him to merge, since it's his PR and you asked us to merge only our own. I've added this, and the lesson behind it, to the merge plan page. Our pre-merge simulation only included our own PRs, not other open PRs touching the same code.\n\nI'm still waiting on the last CI run on graph main and will report when it finishes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1249,"cache_read_input_tokens":235952,"output_tokens":230,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1249,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":230,"cache_read_input_tokens":235952,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1249,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1249},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"df5721a7-025a-41cb-adfd-5b79ab266325","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPToxk6CYEkavvPMc6TW","requestRef":"022a7f7a-444e-4359-bc31-e077076ec333","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"07d3b11a-6744-4cad-94a7-cafca2d75d98","timestamp"