{"parentUuid":"77832f65-8fa8-4dee-87b0-e0e06901ab15","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPUGnwEpifaUy1Ea6gw5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, it's finished: all 25 PRs are merged (12 graph, 13 Brain). Graph main has passed CI. Brain main is red right now because of a teammate's PR, not ours, and he already has a fix open.\n\n**Graph:** the first CI run after my last merge passed fully (tests, the partial-clone CI job, everything). A teammate, evisdren, merged his #383 on top since then, and main stayed green. The code I merged is byte-identical to the combined branch that was fully tested beforehand.\n\n**Brain:** evisdren merged his own #496 right after the Brain session's last merge. It renamed a helper that one of #483's tests calls, so the two together don't compile. His one-file fix, #497, has passing checks so far. The Brain session and I agreed not to merge someone else's PR, so it's his to land.\n\n**What you should still do**\n1. **Build a new graph nightly or release from main.** Until you do, nobody, including you, gets the graph fixes. Brain's new \"how stale is this code context\" note (#484) also stays switched off until then.\n2. **Check that #497 lands** so Brain main goes green again. If it sits for a while, nudge evisdren.\n3. **Make the remaining decisions** listed on the page:\n   - build-then-swap;\n   - per-session transcript mode;\n   - whether to make the old-git CI job required;\n   - deleting the 37 GB Brain store;\n   - the 63 `~/Documents/Coding` folders;\n   - the 3 `entire` CLI bugs;\n   - the unreadable `cli` checkpoint;\n   - the Linear connector;\n   - your old drafts.\n4. Run `/compact`.\n\n**Follow-ups already in progress**\n- The Brain session is writing a fix for the one review finding that turned up in already-merged Brain code (#481).\n\nThe merge plan page has every merge commit and these notes: https://claude.ai/artifact/FkY6c5J1XdzaYGM1Q7T9dU"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":824,"cache_read_input_tokens":238999,"output_tokens":665,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":14},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":824,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":665,"cache_read_input_tokens":238999,"cache_creation_input_tokens":824,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":824},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"520aaeb5-000f-4859-9d77-db6b42074cd3","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgPUGnbtagLphtJK6u3Bq","requestRef":"1c90140d-7448-40d8-b835-fcf36d8e3205","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"db26cef3-4580-4144-b12d-6fc2c60dcbb5","timestamp":"2026-10-25T19:00:44.168Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
