{"parentUuid":"f340e370-71e1-4251-83d1-73ba9102f3c6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPV4Tw1a8K8981E55KvT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two updates on the Brain side:\n\n- **Brain main will go green soon without anyone touching evisdren's PR.** The Brain session's own fix PR (#499) contains the same one-line compile fix as #497. It's set to merge automatically once its required checks pass, and whichever of the two lands first turns main green.\n- **Correction: the Brain follow-up was a real bug, not a theoretical one.** Code merged from #481 could produce an incomplete Brain export while marking it as complete. #499 fixes that. It also deliberately makes exports stricter: one that used to go out despite an unreadable checkpoint may now refuse with `checkpoint_scope_incomplete`, as intended.\n\nOne caution I passed to the Brain session: auto-merge waits only for GitHub's required checks, not for Entire's agent review. I asked it to confirm 0 open findings on #499's trail before the merge fires, and to cancel the auto-merge if anything shows up.\n\nThe page now reflects both: https://claude.ai/artifact/FkY6c5J1XdzaYGM1Q7T9dU. Your to-do list is the same as in my last message."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2234,"cache_read_input_tokens":243022,"output_tokens":434,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":61},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2234,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":434,"cache_read_input_tokens":243022,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2234,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2234},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transfor