{"parentUuid":"b8a02ea2-8ef8-477a-b515-23c0eb3e4dfd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPq8LT13CzVL92mfnFGa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 25 PRs are merged and both main branches are passing CI again.\n\n- **Graph:** all 12 are in. Main is at 726638d1, which is our last merge plus evisdren's #383, and CI passed on every check.\n- **Brain:** all 13 are in. Main was red for about 25 minutes. That was evisdren's #496, which renamed a function our #483's test calls; neither PR broke anything alone. His fix #497 merged at 19:10. Then the Brain session's #499 merged at 19:17, fixing the export that could be marked complete when it wasn't. CI has passed on every commit since, up to caac7622.\n- **One open question:** I can't confirm Entire's review actually ran on #499 before it merged automatically. Its trail shows zero findings and its gate check said it didn't apply. That looks the same whether the review passed or never ran. I've asked the Brain session; if it didn't run, a review after the fact is that session's call.\n\n**Your remaining items:**\n1. Cut a graph nightly (a release built from main). None of the graph improvements reach anyone, including you, until one exists.\n2. The decisions on the page:\n   - Brain build-then-swap\n   - Transcript re-distill cost\n   - Making the lazy-fetch CI job required\n   - The 37 GB Brain store delete\n   - The 63 ~/Documents/Coding paths\n   - 3 cli issues\n   - cli checkpoint 18b787bf552f\n   - Re-adding the Linear connector\n   - Old drafts #146, #300 and #249\n3. /compact.\n\nThe overview page now shows both main branches green: https://claude.ai/artifact/FkY6c5J1XdzaYGM1Q7T9dU"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1007,"cache_read_input_tokens":133766,"output_tokens":577,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":14},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1007,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":577,"cache_read_input_tokens":133766,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1007,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1007},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"14e8450e-1f89-4f8c-9e52-094eaf310e67","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgPq8L7emMnY34z8GhP3s","requestRef":"6b526d49-51b7-49a5-b883-6583c444f291","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"033a5487-cd2a-41b3-9fd3-4e92813486ec","timestamp":"2026-10-25T23:34:11.376Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
