{"parentUuid":"0cfe6e39-e9e0-4294-b5be-40eab079499b","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PreToolUse:Bash","toolUseID":"toolu_01CETtqFp1zzR74jKFyjdQEp","hookEvent":"PreToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"PreToolUse\",\"permissionDecisionReason\":\"RTK auto-rewrite\",\"updatedInput\":{\"command\":\"rtk read /Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/brain-mcp-cannot-write-facts.md | head -30\",\"description\":\"Read existing brain MCP memory\"}}}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"rtk hook claude","durationMs":13},"type":"attachment","uuid":"80f1b97a-9a88-4d01-b261-fe4a9ff77b39","timestamp":"2026-10-28T02:02:54.804Z","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
{"parentUuid":"0cfe6e39-e9e0-4294-b5be-40eab079499b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9e7accba-802a-483c-bfdb-340fdd706b57","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CETtqFp1zzR74jKFyjdQEp","type":"tool_result","content":"---\nname: brain-mcp-cannot-write-facts\ndescription: The RELEASED brain (v0.1.0) has 36 MCP tools and no brain_remember; main has 37 and does. brain_recall exists nowhere on MCP. Write facts via the CLI.\nmetadata:\n  type: reference\n---\n\n**Corrected twice. The final, verified picture:**\n\n|                      | v0.1.0 (what installs) | main |\n|----------------------|------------------------|------|\n| `brain_*` MCP tools  | **36**                 | **37** |\n| `brain_remember`     | absent                 | present (`mcp.go:906`, added in `03655cc0`) |\n| `brain_recall`       | absent                 | **absent** |\n\nIf my MCP surface shows 36 brain tools and no `brain_remember`, **I am talking\nto v0.1.0**, not main. That is a fingerprint worth checking before blaming code.\n\n`brain_remember` on main requires `path` deliberately, so an MCP write never\nshells out to a classifier and never spends model tokens. Good design, already\nbuilt, just unreleased — which is the sharpest concrete argument for cutting a\nrelease (COR-2157): *the shipped brain cannot record a memory.*\n\n**To actually write and recall, use the CLI:**\n\n    entire brain remember '<fact>' --path <category.sub.kind> --kind <kind> --branch main --json\n    entire brain recall   '<question>' --branch main --json\n\nVerified 2026-10-16: 3 facts written, 3/3 retrieved by distinct queries. The\nbinary is `~/.local/share/entire/plugins/bin/entire-brain`, not whatever","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"86364b1c-2290-4460-ba53-4836cf06c8ae","timestamp":"2026-10-28T02:02:59.286Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"---\nname: brain-mcp-cannot-write-facts\ndescription: The RELEASED brain (v0.1.0) has 36 MCP tools and no brain_remember; main has 37 and does. brain_recall exists nowhere on MCP. Write facts via the CLI.\nmetadata:\n  type: reference\n---\n\n**Corrected twice. The final, verified picture:**\n\n|                      | v0.1.0 (what installs) | main |\n|----------------------|------------------------|------|\n| `brain_*` MCP tools  | **36**                 | **37** |\n| `brain_remember`     | absent                 | present (`mcp.go:906`, added in `03655cc0`) |\n| `brain_recall`       | absent                 | **absent** |\n\nIf my MCP surface shows 36 brain tools and no `brain_remember`, **I am talking\nto v0.1.0**, not main. That is a fingerprint worth checking before blaming code.\n\n`brain_remember` on main requires `path` deliberately, so an MCP write never\nshells out to a classifier and never spends model tokens. Good design, already\nbuilt, just unreleased — which is the sharpest concrete argument for cutting a\nrelease (COR-2157): *the shipped brain cannot record a memory.*\n\n**To actually write and recall, use the CLI:**\n\n    entire brain remember '<fact>' --path <category.sub.kind> --kind <kind> --branch main --json\n    entire brain recall   '<question>' --branch main --json\n\nVerified 2026-10-16: 3 facts written, 3/3 retrieved by distinct queries. The\nbinary is `~/.local/share/entire/plugins/bin/entire-brain`, not whatever","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"f8b5a03f-ae61-42b9-80bd-e04875b0bfbc","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0cfe6e39-e9e0-4294-b5be-40eab079499b","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
