{"parentUuid":"52eeaab3-fa1f-406c-8868-ab4d4057058b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgTp8842WMjmZDDMj6eKz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2175,"cache_read_input_tokens":167858,"output_tokens":849,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":19},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2175,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":849,"cache_read_input_tokens":167858,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2175,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2175},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7076,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"24c1a046-1776-474f-b18d-f7f03e0ad5ed","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgTp87oduGbw9ffyXhtmo","requestRef":"da96e16d-8e01-4fc0-8563-b76bdc163af9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ac10020c-df5f-4129-b92f-8c4d332060a4","timestamp":"2026-10-28T02:03:25.639Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
{"parentUuid":"ac10020c-df5f-4129-b92f-8c4d332060a4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgTp8842WMjmZDDMj6eKz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Upgrading Brain to v0.4.0 removed its MCP tools on purpose (brain #509 and #521). That leaves a broken entry in your config and stale lines in your CLAUDE.md files. Everything is otherwise current, but four small items need your yes.\n\n**1. Brain MCP is gone.**\n- `entire brain mcp` now fails with \"unknown command\".\n- Your `~/.claude.json` still has an `entire-brain` MCP server for devenv that runs that command, so it will fail to connect in new devenv sessions.\n- `devenv/CLAUDE.md` and your global `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` still tell agents to use `brain_*` tools.\n- The Brain CLI covers the same ground: `recall`, `brief`, `remember`, `capabilities` and `status` all still work on v0.4.0.\n\n**2. Graph shows \"degraded\" on entire-brain, but the code is fully covered.**\n- Graph labels a repo \"degraded\" if any file fails to parse.\n- On entire-brain, all 47 failures are JSON data files: 46 rejected as \"minified\" (mostly benchmark fixtures), one too large. Every Go and Python file was indexed.\n- The old Oct 24 build prints the same result, so v0.6.0 didn't cause it.\n- The risk is that agents see \"degraded\" and fall back to grep. A fix would be to say \"degraded\" only when source code fails to parse.\n- The same check showed a search miss. The graph didn't surface the `covers()` function for a query that plainly described it, and its top two results tied.\n\n**3.** `entire sem` still runs an old separate build, as I mentioned earlier.\n\n**Want me to do these?**\n1. Remove the dead `entire-brain` MCP entry from `~/.claude.json`.\n2. Update both CLAUDE.md files to point at the Brain CLI instead of `brain_*` tools.\n3. Run `entire plugin remove sem`. It unregisters the old build and deletes no files.\n4. Open a graph PR so \"degraded\" fires only when source code fails to parse.\n\nThe Brain session is taking the duplicate-facts cleanup in its own lane. 97% of active Brain facts have never been returned by any search. The board and memory are updated with all of this.\n\nYour other items are unchanged: the decisions on the page (https://claude.ai/artifact/FkY6c5J1XdzaYGM1Q7T9dU), the `gate-neutral-reads-as-reviewed` request, and /compact."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2175,"cache_read_input_tokens":167858,"output_tokens":849,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":19},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2175,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":849,"cache_read_input_tokens":167858,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2175,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2175},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"24c1a046-1776-474f-b18d-f7f03e0ad5ed","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgTp87oduGbw9ffyXhtmo","requestRef":"da96e16d-8e01-4fc0-8563-b76bdc163af9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a9022db6-3659-4b52-864f-a17c1b731a11","timestamp":"2026-10-28T02:03:26.436Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
