{"parentUuid":"dc919e04-0048-4f45-a9cd-6f3f32791c8f","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14825152 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"3ffba46f-cd45-47b4-ac98-58ec76097b8a","timestamp":"2026-10-28T02:05:47.073Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14825152 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire.io","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
{"parentUuid":"3ffba46f-cd45-47b4-ac98-58ec76097b8a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgTpKC7eaVTg7Lx59KnP8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Swapping in graph v0.6.0 left four repos without Brain's code index. Brain's \"brief\" and \"code\" answers in those repos have no code to draw on until each is repaired. The repair writes to the shared Brain store, which is the Brain session's lane, so I handed it over rather than run it myself.\n\n**Brain's code index after the swap** (Brain rebuilds it with `entire brain repair`):\n\n| Repo | Code index | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| entire-brain | ✅ rebuilt | the Brain session repaired it |\n| entire-graph | ❌ missing | |\n| cli, entiredb | ❌ missing | Should now build, since v0.6.0 can index these partial clones (that's #372). I asked for the coverage numbers to confirm it works on real repos. |\n| entire.io | ❌ missing | This Brain uses an old layout. Fixing it means a one-time refresh with an older Brain (0.2.0), or a backup and full rebuild. That's your call. |\n\n**Two corrections from the Brain session:**\n- **Duplicate facts are already fixed.** `entire brain refresh` removed them. Entire-brain's main partition went from 7,526 rows (74% duplicates) to 1,959 unique facts, and a 10-result recall now returns 10 different facts. Ignore the duplicate number in my last message.\n- **What the duplicates were hiding:** recall still misses the best fact on some questions. That looks like the same kind of problem as the graph not finding `covers()`. Both are logged on the board, to be read together.\n\n**It independently confirmed the \"degraded\" finding:** all 47 failures are JSON, zero are source files. It had told you entire-brain's coverage was \"worth watching\" because of that one word, and has since corrected that with you. That's the misreading a fix would prevent.\n\nYour four yes/no items from my last message are unchanged:\n1. Remove the dead Brain MCP entry from `~/.claude.json`.\n2. Update both CLAUDE.md files.\n3. `entire plugin remove sem`.\n4. A graph PR to stop the false \"degraded\" label."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1516,"cache_read_input_tokens":173564,"output_tokens":699,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1516,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":699,"cache_read_input_tokens":173564,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1516,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1516},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"328c64ba-ceb4-4c88-aac5-c2a2850957aa","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgTpKBq37vkUNRsT2xm8X","requestRef":"23a8ce8a-93cb-4412-adb2-a613ff545c59","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1bc2a456-8b8e-41cf-9c86-1cbece936ca6","timestamp":"2026-10-28T02:05:55.468Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire.io","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
