{"parentUuid":"ee06c351-14c3-431f-b78f-3ff6f8484715","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgTpmn8GcjPPHT5vKmiDX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The repairs finished, and graph v0.6.0 indexed cli and entiredb even though both are partial clones. That's #372 working on real repos. The same check turned up one new graph bug.\n\n**What the repairs showed:**\n- **#372 works:** cli indexed 1,427 files and entiredb 2,542, with no partial-clone refusal. This shows these repos now build where that kind of repo used to be refused. It isn't a controlled before/after, because nobody captured a refusal on these exact repos first.\n- **Brain's code index is back** on entire-graph, cli and entiredb. entire.io still needs your call: an old-layout Brain, fixed by a one-time refresh with Brain 0.2.0 or a backup and full rebuild.\n\n**New graph bug: it can't parse Go 1.26's new `new(value)` syntax.**\n- In entiredb, four test files that `gofmt` accepts as valid Go fail to parse in graph. Every failing line uses Go 1.26's `new(expression)` form, for example `new(0)`, `new(\"4242\")` and `new(now.Add(-90 * time.Minute))`.\n- Graph's bundled Go parser is from August 2024, older than that syntax. The graph may miss some code facts in those files.\n- cli and entiredb are both on Go 1.26, so this will spread as people use the new form.\n- The other 10 parse errors in entiredb are in SQL, protobuf and shell files, where the parsers don't cover every dialect.\n\n**This narrows the \"degraded\" fix (item 4 below):** entiredb's \"degraded\" label is deserved, because real Go files fail. The fix would still clear the false label on entire-brain and cli, where only JSON fails.\n\nBoth bugs are on the board under graph follow-ups, with the evidence.\n\n**Still waiting on your yes:**\n1. Remove the dead Brain MCP entry from `~/.claude.json`.\n2. Update both CLAUDE.md files to point at the Brain CLI.\n3. `entire plugin remove sem`.\n4. A graph PR so \"degraded\" only appears when source code fails to parse.\n5. A graph PR to update the Go parser so Go 1.26 `new(value)` parses."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1911,"cache_read_input_tokens":190347,"output_tokens":727,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1911,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":727,"cache_read_input_tokens":190347,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1911,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1911},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f2a4aa84-dd5f-489f-b226-fb91c4886328","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgTpmmrQ5TCLDVWWA51RQ","requestRef":"78cff35b-7ed5-40e4-b95b-98fdffe5441d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7e3faec4-fa75-4f5e-ad44-d455b0a96008","timestamp":"2026-10-28T02:11:55.607Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
