{"parentUuid":"f4825d29-7036-43e3-a28a-c15be9720356","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"25cb20de-5432-4f3a-8488-0ed1c3943a6c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BpXXVQLe8daXcWNHYyFoLB","type":"tool_result","content":"top-level mcpServers: ['context7', 'puppeteer']\n/Users/suhaan/.claude/CLAUDE.md:14:- entire-brain MCP tools: `brain_brief`/`brain_context` (task-scoped packet), `brain_recall` (prior decisions), `brain_remember` (record one), `brain_impact` (blast radius), `brain_code`/`brain_search_graph` (find by intent), `brain_query`, `brain_status` (which sources are live for this repo). There is **no** `brain_search`, and `brain_vsearch` is **not** vector search — semantic retrieval was removed (trail #278) and it is a compatibility alias over the same BM25 ranking. `entire brain capabilities --json` is authoritative.\n/Users/suhaan/.claude/CLAUDE.md:16:Run `brain_status` first — it reports whether facts/semantic are built for the repo you're in (the code graph is built for all; durable facts only where reported).\n/Users/suhaan/devenv/CLAUDE.md:147:Knowledge, history and durable memories (CLI, or the `brain_*` MCP tools):\n/Users/suhaan/devenv/CLAUDE.md:165:- `brain_impact`, `brain_context`, `brain_status`, `brain_search_graph`, `brain_code`, `brain_query`\n/Users/suhaan/devenv/CLAUDE.md:167:Two corrections to what this file used to claim: there is **no `brain_search`** tool (the symbol\n/Users/suhaan/devenv/CLAUDE.md:168:tool is `brain_search_graph`), and `brain_vsearch` is **not** vector search — semantic retrieval\nManage Entire plugins.\n\nPlugins are external executables named 'entire-<name>'. The CLI discovers\nplugins on $PATH and from a per-user managed directory which is\nauto-prepended to PATH at startup. The managed directory is, in order of\nprecedence:\n\n  $ENTIRE_PLUGIN_DIR/bin (override)\n  $XDG_DATA_HOME/entire/plugins/bin (Linux/macOS, when set)\n  ~/.local/share/entire/plugins/bin (Linux/macOS default)\n  %LOCALAPPDATA%\\entire\\plugins\\bin (Windows, when set)\n  ~\\AppData\\Local\\entire\\plugins\\bin (Windows fallback when LOCALAPPDATA is unset)\n\nInstall sources:\n  entire plugin install run                                    index lookup\n  entire plugin install https://github.com/entireio/entire-run repository URL\n  entire plugin install ./dist/entire-run                      local executable\n\nRemote installs resolve the newest semver tag over the git protocol, then\ndownload the platform's release asset (verified against the release's\nchecksums.txt when published). Discovery uses a git-synced plugin index;\nsee 'entire plugin search' and 'entire plugin index update'.\n\nUsage:\n  entire plugin [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  browse      Interactively browse the plugin index and install\n  doctor      Check installed plugins for missing dependencies and broken entries\n  index       Manage the plugin index\nManaged plugin directory: /Users/suhaan/.local/share/entire/plugins/bin\n\n  brain                v0.4.0             → /Users/suhaan/.local/share/entire/plugins/pkg/brain/entire-brain\n  graph                v0.6.0             → /Users/suhaan/.local/share/entire/plugins/pkg/graph/entire-graph\n  judge                                   → /Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-judge/entire-judge\n  sem                                     → /Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-sem/entire-sem","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ed997bd3-f592-4649-b4de-c0c2925bc5f5","timestamp":"2026-10-30T01:05:26.687Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"top-level mcpServers: ['context7', 'puppeteer']\n/Users/suhaan/.claude/CLAUDE.md:14:- entire-brain MCP tools: `brain_brief`/`brain_context` (task-scoped packet), `brain_recall` (prior decisions), `brain_remember` (record one), `brain_impact` (blast radius), `brain_code`/`brain_search_graph` (find by intent), `brain_query`, `brain_status` (which sources are live for this repo). There is **no** `brain_search`, and `brain_vsearch` is **not** vector search — semantic retrieval was removed (trail #278) and it is a compatibility alias over the same BM25 ranking. `entire brain capabilities --json` is authoritative.\n/Users/suhaan/.claude/CLAUDE.md:16:Run `brain_status` first — it reports whether facts/semantic are built for the repo you're in (the code graph is built for all; durable facts only where reported).\n/Users/suhaan/devenv/CLAUDE.md:147:Knowledge, history and durable memories (CLI, or the `brain_*` MCP tools):\n/Users/suhaan/devenv/CLAUDE.md:165:- `brain_impact`, `brain_context`, `brain_status`, `brain_search_graph`, `brain_code`, `brain_query`\n/Users/suhaan/devenv/CLAUDE.md:167:Two corrections to what this file used to claim: there is **no `brain_search`** tool (the symbol\n/Users/suhaan/devenv/CLAUDE.md:168:tool is `brain_search_graph`), and `brain_vsearch` is **not** vector search — semantic retrieval\nManage Entire plugins.\n\nPlugins are external executables named 'entire-<name>'. The CLI discovers\nplugins on $PATH and from a per-user managed directory which is\nauto-prepended to PATH at startup. The managed directory is, in order of\nprecedence:\n\n  $ENTIRE_PLUGIN_DIR/bin (override)\n  $XDG_DATA_HOME/entire/plugins/bin (Linux/macOS, when set)\n  ~/.local/share/entire/plugins/bin (Linux/macOS default)\n  %LOCALAPPDATA%\\entire\\plugins\\bin (Windows, when set)\n  ~\\AppData\\Local\\entire\\plugins\\bin (Windows fallback when LOCALAPPDATA is unset)\n\nInstall sources:\n  entire plugin install run                                    index lookup\n  entire plugin install https://github.com/entireio/entire-run repository URL\n  entire plugin install ./dist/entire-run                      local executable\n\nRemote installs resolve the newest semver tag over the git protocol, then\ndownload the platform's release asset (verified against the release's\nchecksums.txt when published). Discovery uses a git-synced plugin index;\nsee 'entire plugin search' and 'entire plugin index update'.\n\nUsage:\n  entire plugin [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  browse      Interactively browse the plugin index and install\n  doctor      Check installed plugins for missing dependencies and broken entries\n  index       Manage the plugin index\nManaged plugin directory: /Users/suhaan/.local/share/entire/plugins/bin\n\n  brain                v0.4.0             → /Users/suhaan/.local/share/entire/plugins/pkg/brain/entire-brain\n  graph                v0.6.0             → /Users/suhaan/.local/share/entire/plugins/pkg/graph/entire-graph\n  judge                                   → /Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-judge/entire-judge\n  sem                                     → /Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-sem/entire-sem","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[],"moreFiles":0,"unavailable":true}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"17928a65-85d3-4851-9987-07031a2e178f","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":261},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/entire.io","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/entiredb","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f4825d29-7036-