{"parentUuid":"e421019f-d696-4037-b782-1ce51e047f19","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgXXdc37G7mCHQenZw935","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The three config changes are done, and a fix agent is now building the graph PR.\n\n**Done:**\n1. **Dead brain MCP entry:** the brain session had already removed it from `~/.claude.json` on 2026-10-28, with a backup at `~/.claude.json.bak-20261028-brainmcp`. Nothing more was needed.\n2. **`sem` plugin unregistered:** only the plugin registration was removed, and the binary in `~/Documents/Coding/entire-sem` is untouched. `entire sem` no longer runs, while graph v0.6.0 and brain v0.4.0 are unaffected. I checked first that nothing depends on it: the brain-memory mod only pattern-matches command text, and the status line reads a script file directly.\n3. **Both CLAUDE.md files updated:** the `brain_*` MCP tool names are replaced with the brain command-line verbs (`brief`, `recall`, `remember`, `status`, `inspect`, `capabilities --json`). The `entire sem` lines now say it's gone.\n\n**In progress, the graph PR:** one PR in three commits, built in its own worktree off the latest main.\n- **\"Degraded\" label:** JSON and other data-file skips no longer mark coverage as \"degraded\". They stay listed; only the label changes. Real source-code failures and repo-wide failures still say \"degraded\".\n- **Go parse errors:** when Go's own parser accepts a file that graph's bundled parser chokes on, graph reports a grammar-gap warning instead of a parse error. Genuinely broken Go still gets the parse error.\n- **Machine-readable scope:** each failure gets a field saying whether it affects one file or the whole index. A new entry in graph's capabilities output lets brain detect the field, so `entities migrate` can tell a harmless warning from a real one.\n\nGraph's parser version number stays at 4, so brain's entity indexes won't be stranded. The agent opens the PR but does not merge it. When it reports back, I'll check the results myself before telling you it's ready."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3411,"cache_read_input_tokens":181356,"output_tokens":685,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":13},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3411,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":685,"cache_read_input_tokens":181356,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3411,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3411},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f85a880f-2c6a-47e1-98d5-1f9073af1b68","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgXXdbj1pvVeocJi2DtYr","requestRef":"bcb0d919-4c9d-4814-8c76-21d98a6bf6d3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8727ad49-13f1-4b3b-bd37-109321cc794b","timestamp":"2026-10-30T01:09:31.468Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
