{"parentUuid":"962734bd-d090-4bdd-bc3c-0aa507261781","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgXYHoS1omtKgUWN55VYE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The brain session found an old copy of the brain plugin (v0.1.0) earlier on the PATH. It was breaking the pre-edit hook in the entire-brain repo on every Edit and Write. They moved it aside with `mv`, so one command puts it back. Nothing of mine used it.\n\nThey also flagged a bad instruction. Following it up, I found and fixed one on our side:\n- **The problem:** `devenv/CLAUDE.md` told agents to pass `--branch main` to both `recall` and `brief`. The installed brain v0.4.0 rejects that flag on `brief` (\"unknown flag\"), so every `brief` call that followed the instruction failed. `recall` accepts it fine.\n- **The fix:** CLAUDE.md now says to use it on `recall` only, until `brief --help` lists the flag. I corrected the same claim in my memory notes.\n- **Graph is fine:** graph's own agent guide lists `--branch` only for commands that accept it.\n- **Brain's own fix:** the brain session has added the flag to `brief` on an unreleased brain branch.\n\nThe graph PR agent is still running. I'll check its results before reporting back."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":893,"cache_read_input_tokens":188849,"output_tokens":383,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":893,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":383,"cache_read_input_tokens":188849,"cache_creation_input_tokens":893,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":893},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"dia