{"parentUuid":"e9bf7ec2-0adc-459e-9517-8926edf79972","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgXaeTkQu5pA7UL26KwwP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No changes needed on my side.\n\n- **The `brief --branch` note in CLAUDE.md:** brain has added the flag on a branch that isn't merged yet. The line I wrote already says to use it on `brief` only once `entire brain brief --help` lists it, so it stays correct after that merges.\n- **A stuck brain background process is burning CPU.** It has run at about 1.1 cores for 42 hours and made no progress. The cause is one 256 MiB session transcript that aborts brain's memory-extraction run every time. Brain #483 fixed the same failure in a different part of brain, not this one. I've told the graph PR agent so its before/after timing runs both versions under the same load and notes it. Stopping the process or fixing the bug is your call or the brain session's.\n- **New context in entire-brain sessions:** the brain hook that runs before Edit/Write now works. In entire-brain sessions you may see brain memories show up when a file is edited; that's expected.\n\nThe graph PR agent is still running."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":726,"cache_read_input_tokens":190906,"output_tokens":426,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":99},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":726,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":426,"cache_read_input_tokens":190906,"cache_creation_input_tokens":726,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":726},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serve