**Graph** (entireio/entire-graph): #142 and #370-#380, all CI-green.\n44\t  - Findings verified per trail with `--trail entire-graph/<n> --status any --freshness any` plus a branch match: 0 open.\n45\t  - Draft **#381** (DO NOT MERGE) combines all 12 and is green.\n46\t- **Brain** (entireio/entire-brain): #473, #474, #476-#484, #488, #489, all green.\n47\t  - The 4 findings (#477/#483/#484/#489) are fixed.\n48\t  - Draft #493 was the combined PR; now closed (see above).\n49\t- **Merge plan:** the \"Merge plan\" tab of https://claude.ai/artifact/FkY6c5J1XdzaYGM1Q7T9dU.\n50\t  - Rebase patches are in `~/devenv-worktrees/handoff/{graph,brain}-patches`.\n51\t  - Graph detail: `handoff/HANDOFF-GRAPH.md`. Brain decisions: `devenv/DECISIONS-FOR-YOU.md`.\n52\t  - **Re-run the merge simulation right before merging**: main drifts, and one brain PR went from clean to\n53\t    conflicting within hours.\n54\t- **Graph merge order:** 370 → 371 → 377 (retarget) → 373 → 379 → 376 → 375 → 372 → 380 → 374 → 142 (3 patches) →\n55\t  378 (3 patches). Graph #380 before brain #484.\n56\t- **Fresh-env adoption on the combined graph build:** main sessions and Explore subagents went graph-first in every\n57\t  searching task, with 0 graph failures. The harness now installs via `entire graph setup`.\n58\t- **User decisions pending:**\n59\t  - approvals on 25 PRs;\n60\t  - brain build-then-swap CAS vs the non-interleaving invariant;\n61\t  - the transcript-mode re-distill cost;\n62\t  - making the lazy-fetch CI job required;\n63\t  - the 37 GB brain store delete;\n64\t  - 63 ~/Documents/Coding paths;\n65\t  - 3 cli-lane issues;\n66\t  - old drafts #146/#300 and community #249;\n67\t  - cli checkpoint 18b787bf552f (shared remote cleanup); Linear connector re-add.\n68\t\n69\tSupersedes [[graph-landing-paused-state]]. Related: [[announce-before-swapping-shared-binaries]],\n70\t[[green-suite-is-not-evidence]], [[mutation-didnt-fire-suspect-the-test]].\n71\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"