— cell wants snake_case branch_name/branch_action, additi\n- [Sessions invisible: wrong git identity](sessions-invisible-wrong-git-identity.md) — user.email=r@r repo-locally; server attri\n- [Distill cache stores hashes, not facts](distill-cache-stores-hashes-not-facts.md) — branch-partitioned facts + hash-only cach\n- [Polling cannot wait for a detached child](polling-cannot-wait-for-a-detached-child.md) — launchDetachedSelf returns at Start(\n- [Actually use graph + brain](actually-use-graph-and-brain.md) — user caught me using git/grep for code/history Qs; preflight +\n- [No merge asks until finished](no-merge-asks-until-finished.md) — user merges once at the end; never ask for merges/approvals\n- [Semantic layer team protocol](semantic-layer-team-protocol.md) — graph + brain sessions coordinate via ListAgents/SendMessage\n- [One file aborted the whole export](one-file-aborted-the-whole-export.md) — 13-day frozen brain; `memory migrate` said healthy\n- [Counters blind to Bash searches](counters-blind-to-bash-searches.md) — ~30 shell greps scored zero; fix the enforcement befor\n- [os.Executable is a fork bomb in tests](os-executable-is-a-fork-bomb-in-tests.md) — spawning it under go test re-runs the pack\n- [ENTIRE_PLUGIN_DIR redirects the store](plugin-dir-redirects-the-store.md) — refresh under it hits an EMPTY store; check `conf\n- [Announce before swapping shared binaries](announce-before-swapping-shared-binaries.md) — swapping ~/.local/bin/entire mid-tim\n- [Routed list capped at 100](routed-list-capped-at-100.md) — host caps at 100, cap stated only in prose; brain called it \"compl\n- [Export cost is metadata, not membership](export-cost-is-metadata.md) — 97.7% of export children avoidable; local snapshot is\n- [Trail findings: wrong trail number](trail-findings-wrong-trail-number.md) — repo-scoped URL number != project trail number; \"\n- [Build failure is not a weakening red](build-failure-is-not-a-weakening-red.md) — `[build failed]` greps as `^FAIL`; gr