Verdict, one of exactly: GOOD / NEEDS-WORK / SUPERSEDED / OUT-OF-SCOPE / TRASH\n   - GOOD = real bug, correct minimal fix, has a test, mergeable as-is\n   - NEEDS-WORK = real bug, fix broken/overreaching/untested\n   - SUPERSEDED = already fixed on main\n   - OUT-OF-SCOPE = works but is an unrequested feature / product decision / unreviewable refactor, not a fix\n   - TRASH = not a real bug, or the fix is wrong, or AI slop with no substance\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT — caveman-ultra compressed, this exact shape, nothing else:\n```\nN | VERDICT | <=22 words why | EVIDENCE: <one command output, commit sha, or file:line that proves it> | CI: <n checks|never ran>\n```\nOne line per PR, 12 lines. Then at most 5 lines under `FLAG:` naming PRs whose verdict would change a merge decision and that you are less than confident about, with the exact thing I should re-verify myself.\n\nNo preamble, no summary paragraph, no markdown headings beyond what is specified. Dense factual lines only.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/323e0f71-94c9-40df-877e-b0c11113f22d/tasks/a54bf84e42d873d4e.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"fdd8a68a-b0f0-4ea1-bf5a-18af30c46eb1","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/cli","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/cli","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},{"name":"suhaanthayyil","host":"github.com","remote":"suhaanthayyil/cli","visibility":"unknown"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","re