E. #235 Yashwanthk06 NEEDS-REWORK: 15 findings. Headline: risk ranks by DependentsCount = len(index[shortEntityName(change)]) (dependents.go:663 referenceName -> shortEntityName) = a NAME-FREQUENCY count, so live runs put struct fields named err/n and vendored parser.h fields in the top 5 of 705 entities, 700 silently dropped, recommended_tests empty. overall_risk computed only from post-cap survivors. Zero-filled graph_evidence serialises identically to '0 callers'. 22 of 43 mutations GREEN. 307 of 1016 lines are hackathon scaffolding (unvalidated Databricks bundle, BUILDATHON.md). #237 saranmahadev RE-AUTHOR: GPS, 6 new top-level commands, genuinely unbuilt but never design-accepted. TRAP: merged tree has TWO `case \\\"context\\\"` at root.go:332+354 in ONE switch = compile error, and git AUTO-MERGES root.go with NO conflict, so nobody resolving its 112 conflicts is ever prompted. 29 goldens carry W_GIT_WORKTREE_FALLBACK ('Git worktree enumeration was unavailable') = author's broken env baked in, so its own verification ran on a degraded snapshot. #249 MuskanPaliwal SUPERSEDED: #219 is fixed on main by f22e6c95 'fix(verify): derive only commands the repository can actually run (#261)' (2026-09-23, ancestor of main, body names #219 AND #203). Bug reproduces at the PR's merge-base, GONE on main. PR would also regress: picks the NEAREST ancestor gradlew then points it up with -p .., running the root build with a nested wrapper (wrong Gradle version). Salvage: the name/setName project-rename check (main only checks projectDir). #265 aniruddhaadak80 REAL BUG, BROKEN AS SUBMITTED: --setup is the one comparability input main never records; fix direction right, but verifyBaselineFormatVersion 1->2 breaks 3 tests (outputpath_test.go:202/463/1049 - VERIFIED FAILING by me). Write-side guard UNFAILABLE: deleting `Setup: flags.Setup` keeps the new test green. Precedent 5c3cf40d used omitempty, no version bump, and updated help.go. #267 aniruddhaadak80 CLEAN - the only one mergeable as-is. Main silently ignores --pre-edit-baseline when --record-baseline is set. Nits only (no t.Parallel, no CHANGELOG). #269 aniruddhaadak80 REAL BUG, FIX OVERREACHES. Verified by direct probe of splitPreflightCommandLine: headline fix WORKS (`--test \\\"go test ./...\\\"` parses), but it adopts POSIX UNQUOTED backslash escaping: `--repo C:\\\\work\\\\repo` -> C:workrepo; `--repo C:\\\\repo\\\\ --query x` -> [\\\"--repo\\\" \\\"C:repo --query\\\" \\\"x\\\"] with err=nil, so --query is SWALLOWED and doctor records an `asserted_command_line` it never checked (false approve); `4\\\\096` -> 4096 passes a malformed number main rejects; `--query don't` now FAILS 'unterminated quote' where main passed. ALSO: #269's parent IS #267's head - merging #269 merges #267. MY CORRECTIONS TO AGENT CLAIMS: (1) #237's duplicate case is NOT in the PR (PR has 1, main has 1) - the merge creates it silently, which is worse. (2) 'risk.go is the only emoji producer, 0 hits elsewhere' is WRONG: risk.go is the only PICTOGRAPHIC emoji producer in prod code, but 24 dingbat chars already ship in 5 prod files (verify_parse.go 17x checkmarks, index.go+root.go warning sign, setup_ui.go, impact_progress.go). CI NEVER RAN on #232/#233/#235/#237/#249/#265/#267/#269 = fork-approval gate, NOT missing workflows (test.yml dates 2026-05-28, triggers on plain pull_request:; later fork PRs #343/#351/#357 got 30-38 checks once approved). One click fixes it for the ones worth testing. *** STILL BLOCKING: evisdren's 2026-11-05 proposal to DELETE `graph verify` (~4,960 prod LoC) moots #237/#249/#265/#267/#269 = 5 of the 9. USER DECISION. *** Nothing pushed, nothing commented, nothing merged, nothing closed.\"","+      \"notes\": \"78 external fork PRs across 3 repos (graph 9, brain 8, cli 61). Buckets: 13 GOOD / 35 NEEDS-WORK / 16 OUT-OF-SCOPE / 10 SUPERSEDED / 4 TRASH. I mutation-proved 6 GOOD myself: graph #392 (+#267 earlier), cli #2611 (--no-overwrite-ignore, 1 line, data loss), cli #2479 (main FAILS under ambient ENTIRE_TEST_TTY=1), cli #2331 (Lefthook OverwritesHooks, red in 2 places), cli #3040 (GIT_PAGER=cat; mutated test HANGS 15s = real repro, but PR is a DRAFT). cli #3005 downgraded: tests pass (4 of 8 new ones matched my filter) but it is 674 lines / 10 commits where 9 are self-corrections about amend+reflog detection, not the billed sibling-idle bug; not mutation-proven. UNVERIFIED BY ME: cli #2911, #2950; brain #554/#605/#606 (brain is the other session's lane). CORRECTION to agent: brain #605 pins test.yml graph ref 56f1de69 which is NOT orphaned - it is graph #392's own head, fetchable as refs/pull/392/head; but it does pin brain's required CI to an unmerged fork PR, so merge graph #392 first then repin. BLOCKED: classifier denied further `go test` on fork code ([Code from External]) - need user permission to finish verifying #2911/#2950. Still true: ZERO fork PRs have ever had CI approved (one click each). graph #357 MERGED 2026-11-05 WITHOUT my 3 fix commits, which remain unpushed on fix/357-followups.\"","     }","   ]","-}","+}"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/todo-board.json"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"69b7b6c0-00fd-4e51-87f4-352ab9b4fb8e","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":268},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibili