{"parentUuid":"ee8a35dc-24f1-4d2e-b7ca-127002c2f1ae","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01YaW7Ca61Pf3HVUQzpLTPkT","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8d7fe803-abd9-4a05-b173-32fe5c985ebe","timestamp":"2026-11-06T21:50:26.138Z","session_id":"323e0f71-94c9-40df-877e-b0c11113f22d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
{"parentUuid":"8d7fe803-abd9-4a05-b173-32fe5c985ebe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgnQuuwKi7HrSRZ5Y2sqM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**8 external PRs on entire-graph.** #249 drops off the list, MuskanPaliwal is an org member.\n\n## Actually good concepts (4)\n\n**#265** — aniruddhaadak80\nSolves **your own issue #222**. A baseline records every comparability input except `--setup`, so you record with one setup, verify against another, and get a silent adjudication that means nothing. You filed it, they found it. Best concept in the set.\n\n**#269** — aniruddhaadak80\n`doctor --assert` splits quoted command arguments, so it can't parse the examples in its own help text. Worse than cosmetic: doctor writes an `asserted_command_line` it never actually checked. **A preflight that quietly approves is worse than no preflight.**\n\n**#267** — aniruddhaadak80\n`--record-baseline` short-circuits and silently ignores `--pre-edit-baseline`. You ask for an adjudicated delta, you get \"BASELINE RECORDED\" and exit 0. The help already documents the two as alternatives, so the code contradicts the docs.\n\n**#392** — Beehtrix\nThe agent guide tells agents `remember --path` without saying hyphens are rejected, and advertises a `brain_remember` MCP tool that was deleted in brain 0.4.0. Agents retry by trial and error. Small, but it's wasted turns on every session.\n\n## Good idea, wrong execution (1)\n\n**#235** — Yashwanthk06\nRank what a changeset puts at risk. **The idea is genuinely valuable** and nothing on main does it. The implementation ranks by how often a short name appears repo-wide, so struct fields called `err` and `n` top the list and 700 of 705 real entities get dropped. Keep the concept, discard the patch.\n\n## Half a good idea (1)\n\n**#233** — souzataniya\nTwo unrelated things in one PR. The evidence-state half (surfacing confidence and resolution on results) is the same gap as **your issue #273**, and it matters because an empty graph result currently reads identically to a resolved \"no consumers.\" The other half is a `graph rank` developer leaderboard. Split it, keep the first part.\n\n## Not worth having (2)\n\n**#237** — saranmahadev. Six new top-level commands for requirement traceability. A product decision nobody made.\n\n**#232** — Shaurya002800. A Python FastAPI app, 2.1 MB of media, zero Go lines.\n\n## The pattern\n\n**aniruddhaadak80 is your best outside contributor on this repo.** Three PRs, three real bugs in `verify`/`doctor`, all in the silent-wrong-answer class, two with their own issues filed first (#266, #268). Their code needs work on all three, but they're finding the bugs that matter.\n\n#232, #233 and #237 are all Bengaluru Tech Week Buildathon submissions, filed within an hour of each other on 6 September."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1088,"cache_read_input_tokens":211351,"output_tokens":952,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1088,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":952,"cache_read_input_tokens":211351,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1088,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1088},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"76e16155-e92c-4f5b-ac1e-949ce47e1091","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgnQuuhS39HiBPutkvu8n","requestRef":"75ee2031-858b-4a63-a561-f90bccfe5495","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b36e3902-0175-45b4-86db-f46fcdc0b07a","timestamp":"2026-11-06T21:50:26.137Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effo