rge graph #392 first then repin. BLOCKED: classifier denied further `go test` on fork code ([Code from External]) - need user permission to finish verifying #2911/#2950. Still true: ZERO fork PRs have ever had CI approved (one click each). graph #357 MERGED 2026-11-05 WITHOUT my 3 fix commits, which remain unpushed on fix/357-followups.\"","+    },","+    {","+      \"id\": \"G-ext-pr-fix-loop\",","+      \"lane\": \"graph\",","+      \"title\": \"Fix the good external graph PRs (no merging)\",","+      \"status\": \"in_progress\",","+      \"owner\": \"claude\",","+      \"notes\": \"Fixing the good-concept external graph PRs on my own branches; NOTHING merged, nothing pushed. DONE #265 (worktree eg-265-fix, branch fix/265-setup-baseline): 3 outputpath_test format_version literals now read the constant (all 3 proven red pre-fix); added write-side round-trip test (PR's own test is unfailable there - proven: dropping the write assignment keeps it green). 17/17 focused tests pass, vet clean, mutation-proven both directions. NEXT: #269 quoting overreach, then #235 ranking, then #233 split.\"","     }","   ]","-}","+}"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/todo-board.json"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"3937136a-530c-4817-8c4b-0dae5447fa41","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":268},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibili