{"parentUuid":"c7fe9254-7185-4de2-ae7a-1caf0017a6cf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgqZVE27L4ZCMLcFebCfR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**5 branches ready. All local, nothing on origin, all worktrees clean.**\n\n| PR | Branch | Tip | Commits | Tests |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **#265** | `fix/265-setup-baseline` | `1fcad141` | 2 | 17/17 cli |\n| **#269** (+#267) | `fix/269-preflight-quoting` | `dc35822c` | 3 | 26 pass / 1 skip |\n| **#235** | `fix/235-risk-preselection` | `2846bad2` | 2 | 13/13 cli |\n| **#233** | `fix/233-evidence-state` | `9a834b43` | 1 | sem 43, cli 97 |\n| **#357 follow-ups** | `fix/357-followups` | `9ca9d2a7` | 3 | mutation-proven, from earlier |\n\nWorktrees are at `~/devenv-worktrees/eg-{265,269,235,233,357}-{fix,review}`.\n\n**What \"ready\" means here:**\n- every guard mutation-proven in both directions\n- build + `go vet` clean, targeted tests green\n- clean worktrees (only `eg-357-review` has an untracked `grammar-refresh` binary, a build artifact)\n- `git ls-remote origin` confirms **none of the 5 exist remotely**\n\n**Not ready / not done:**\n- **#394** (rodbegbie, opened yesterday) — unreviewed. It closes the one claim #357 left unverified.\n- **#237, #232, #392** — concept-judged but unfixed.\n- cli **#2911**, **#2950** — still unverified by me, blocked on your call about running fork code after the classifier denial.\n\nSay push and I'll push all 5 (or name a subset). I won't open PRs or merge without you saying so."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":276,"cache_read_input_tokens":123943,"output_tokens":600,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":276,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iter