{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01PqDMp44x938Dn847VmmdtN","lastSequenceNum":0,"noHistoryBackfill":true,"ownerAccountUuid":"1adeeb49-de49-49d0-b362-b9b5f0bc27ed","ownerOrganizationUuid":"46041b3e-8c7e-4659-a2cb-1751292663c4"}
{"parentUuid":"9ceb447f-0384-4738-ab64-3df2f7d6764c","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14939909 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"a8fe2e42-3c04-41e6-957a-f87ca578c27e","timestamp":"2026-11-08T15:01:42.736Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14939909 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"323e0f71-94c9-40df-877e-b0c11113f22d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
{"parentUuid":"a8fe2e42-3c04-41e6-957a-f87ca578c27e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgqfP5e7fpjdKXBqPtUng","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**#394 reviewed and fixed. Not committed — I can't run the tests.**\n\nBranch `fix/394-grammar-local-build` in `~/devenv-worktrees/eg-394-fix`. All 6 PR commits cherry-picked clean off `origin/main`. My fix sits uncommitted on top: +311/-13.\n\n**Concept verdict: good, and worth landing.** It makes `grammar-refresh` apply the patch and run `tree-sitter-cli` itself, which is exactly the gap #357 left. Its own test suite is strong (it fakes `npx` in-process, so no Node needed). Three defects, all attacking the thing the PR claims to deliver:\n\n**1. The manifest pins the ABI it says it derives.** The PR's headline: \"the ABI comes from one constant (`maxABI`) ... so a runtime upgrade changes one value.\" But `main.go` wrote the *resolved default* back into the manifest, and both committed entries carry `\"generate_args\": [\"--abi\",\"14\"]`. When `maxABI` becomes 15, `TestABIRangeMatchesRuntime` forces the constant edit, every grammar keeps generating ABI 14 off its recorded pin, and `vendor` accepts 14 because it's still inside 13–15. Nothing fails. Fixed: record only args the maintainer actually wrote, and dropped the two derived pins from `grammars.json`. The PR's own `TestRefreshGenerateRecordsLatest` asserted the old behaviour, so that assertion changed too.\n\n**2. A prerelease generator is recorded as a different generator.** `cliVersionPattern` was `\\b\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+\\b`, so `tree-sitter 0.25.0-rc.1` recorded as **`0.25.0`**. The whole `local_build` design rests on \"regenerating the recorded revision reuses the recorded CLI version, so it is reproducible\" — and the pin would have fetched a build that never produced those bytes, silently. Fixed to take the full semver.\n\n**3. A patch that edits `grammar.js` with no generator is a silent no-op.** `patchFile` is applied regardless of `wantsGeneration`. Patch `grammar.js`, skip generation, and the tool copies upstream's committed `parser.c` and prints success. That is #357's original sin reproduced by the tool built to prevent it. Fixed: refuse before the fetch, naming the offending paths. The complement matters too, so a patch confined to vendored files (`src/parser.c`, `src/scanner.c`, headers, LICENSE) still works without generation — the real Swift patch classifies as `grammar.js` + `src/scanner.c`, and Swift has a generator recorded, so it passes.\n\n**What I verified, and what I didn't:**\n- `gofmt` clean, `go vet ./cmd/grammar-refresh` exit 0 with no output, so the package *and the new tests* type-check.\n- Cross-checked both pure-logic pieces in Python against the real `compatibility.patch`: version pattern correct on all 5 cases, old pattern reproduces the `0.25.0` truncation, patch classifier gives `grammar.js` → needs generation, `src/scanner.c` → doesn't.\n- **No mutation proof.** `go test ./cmd/grammar-refresh` is denied by the classifier: `[Code from External]`. Tried the simple single-command form too; denied again. So the 7 new tests have never executed, and I won't commit unproven guards.\n\n**I need one thing from you:** permission to run `go test` on this worktree. Fastest is `! cd ~/devenv-worktrees/eg-394-fix && go test -count=1 ./cmd/grammar-refresh` in the prompt, or a Bash permission rule. Same block still covers cli #2911 and #2950 from earlier.\n\nNothing merged, nothing pushed. The 5 ready branches from before are untouched."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":268,"cache_read_input_tokens":189227,"output_tokens":1311,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":268,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1311,"cache_read_input_tokens":189227,"cache_creation_input_tokens":268,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":268},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0381bbda-8c22-46ba-80be-7dcc554627c3","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgqfP5M1X89Ny3fzGHYCN","requestRef":"a53b2ec7-33ad-4301-8700-a051bf499760","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"760b4053-305d-4858-a1d1-b0e25fb03221","timestamp":"2026-11-08T15:02:00.564Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"323e0f71-94c9-40df-877e-b0c11113f22d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
