{"parentUuid":"be57b9f8-a656-4176-829f-5d45ad246004","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e6359947-31b7-4993-8c7e-d5e7d842d697","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H1q6GwgUf9M64vbtGPMiWJ","type":"tool_result","content":"## Tests\n\n`go test ./internal/agentsetup` covers explicit activation, both orders in empty\nrepositories, migration, byte stability, invalid metadata, and filesystem\nprotections. Activation and installer code and tests are mirrored in both\nrepositories; historical runtime-detection helpers are no longer used by activation.\n\nBrain's `tools/integration` Go tests run both compiled products in both setup\norders in isolated repositories. They check combined activation, preserved user\ntext and repeatability, and compare the normal and strict guides each product\nrenders. After changing `guide.go` or `strict.go` here, run them from an\nentire-brain checkout with the matching guide change, pointing the Graph binary\nat a build of this tree and requiring exact guide parity:\n\n```sh\ncd <entire-brain checkout>\nBRAIN_INTEGRATION_REQUIRED=1 BRAIN_INTEGRATION_REQUIRE_GUIDE_PARITY=1 \\\nBRAIN_INTEGRATION_BRAIN_BINARY=<brain build> BRAIN_INTEGRATION_GRAPH_BINARY=<graph build of this tree> \\\ngo test ./tools/integration -count=1\n```\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"49454492-1084-4654-b296-179ae531eeac","timestamp":"2026-11-08T16:46:03.676Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## Tests\n\n`go test ./internal/agentsetup` covers explicit activation, both orders in empty\nrepositories, migration, byte stability, invalid metadata, and filesystem\nprotections. Activation and installer code and tests are mirrored in both\nrepositories; historical runtime-detection helpers are no longer used by activation.\n\nBrain's `tools/integration` Go tests run both compiled products in both setup\norders in isolated repositories. They check combined activation, preserved user\ntext and repeatability, and compare the normal and strict guides each product\nrenders. After changing `guide.go` or `strict.go` here, run them from an\nentire-brain checkout with the matching guide change, pointing the Graph binary\nat a build of this tree and requiring exact guide parity:\n\n```sh\ncd <entire-brain checkout>\nBRAIN_INTEGRATION_REQUIRED=1 BRAIN_INTEGRATION_REQUIRE_GUIDE_PARITY=1 \\\nBRAIN_INTEGRATION_BRAIN_BINARY=<brain build> BRAIN_INTEGRATION_GRAPH_BINARY=<graph build of this tree> \\\ngo test ./tools/integration -count=1\n```","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"aa30d6ef-489a-40b8-b774-086ac7109aad","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":268},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"be57b9f8-a656-4176-829f-5d45ad246004","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"323e0f71-94c9-40df-877e-b0c11113f22d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
