{"parentUuid":"96e56624-ce23-46f5-8c83-e24925b969b3","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14880006 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"f1778cef-e8ad-491b-b730-28e2e7ef1c6f","timestamp":"2026-11-08T16:47:02.303Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14880006 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"323e0f71-94c9-40df-877e-b0c11113f22d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
{"parentUuid":"f1778cef-e8ad-491b-b730-28e2e7ef1c6f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgqoQvpY1uYef38WDmz8M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01X25epb8Us2Ty15DMiJaczN","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/eg-392-fix && git add -A && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\ntest(agentsetup): hold the guide text to Brain's byte for byte\n\nThe change itself is right. Both guide sources are now identical to\nentire-brain main except the two lines entireio/entire-brain#605 adds, the\nthree cross-repo claims check out (internal/cli/mcp.go is gone from Brain\nmain, tools/integration exists, scripts/test-agent-coordination.py does\nnot), and the strict copy's \"semantic inspection tools\" was real drift that\nBrain had already fixed.\n\nThe test guarding it was not. Brain's compareGuideText compares the two\nrendered guides byte for byte, and the guard checked only that the phrase\n\"lowercase letters, digits and underscores\" appeared somewhere after the\ncommand. Reversing the example to read \"write project.ci-cache.layout, not\nproject.ci_cache.layout\" -- a guide that now instructs agents to use the\nhyphens factPathPattern rejects -- leaves that phrase untouched and the test\ngreen. Verified: under that mutation the original passes and this one fails.\n\nSo the rule is pinned verbatim, line break included, across every\nBrain-enabled guide from AllGuides rather than four hand-listed cases, with\nthe count asserted so a guide that stops mentioning remember fails here\ninstead of being skipped. A second guard holds the removed MCP write\nsentence out of all six guides: it was deleted from two copies and nothing\nstopped a third from reappearing.\n\nFive mutations, each red, two tests sharing none of them: reword the\nexample, reflow the line break, restore the MCP sentence in the strict copy,\ndrop the rule from the strict copy, rename the command.\n\nThe doc now names the dependency. \"Run them with the matching guide change\"\nwas true but quiet: strict parity is byte equality, so running the parity\nleg against Brain main before #605 lands fails on this repository's own\ncorrection, not on a regression.\n\nDropped nothing from the PR.\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -4 | cat && git status --short && echo \"(clean)\"","description":"Commit the 392 fix"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":464,"cache_read_input_tokens":248909,"output_tokens":780,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":464,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":780,"cache_read_input_tokens":248909,"cache_creation_input_tokens":464,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":464},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01X25epb8Us2Ty15DMiJaczN":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/eg-392-fix && git add -A && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\ntest(agentsetup): hold the guide text to Brain's byte for byte\n\nThe change itself is right. Both guide sources are now identical to\nentire-brain main except the two lines entireio/entire-brain#605 adds, the\nthree cross-repo claims check out (internal/cli/mcp.go is gone from Brain\nmain, tools/integration exists, scripts/test-agent-coordination.py does\nnot), and the strict copy's \"semantic inspection tools\" was real drift that\nBrain had already fixed.\n\nThe test guarding it was not. Brain's compareGuideText compares the two\nrendered guides byte for byte, and the guard checked only that the phrase\n\"lowercase letters, digits and underscores\" appeared somewhere after the\ncommand. Reversing the example to read \"write project.ci-cache.layout, not\nproject.ci_cache.layout\" -- a guide that now instructs agents to use the\nhyphens factPathPattern rejects -- leaves that phrase untouched and the test\ngreen. Verified: under that mutation the original passes and this one fails.\n\nSo the rule is pinned verbatim, line break included, across every\nBrain-enabled guide from AllGuides rather than four hand-listed cases, with\nthe count asserted so a guide that stops mentioning remember fails here\ninstead of being skipped. A second guard holds the removed MCP write\nsentence out of all six guides: it was deleted from two copies and nothing\nstopped a third from reappearing.\n\nFive mutations, each red, two tests sharing none of them: reword the\nexample, reflow the line break, restore the MCP sentence in the strict copy,\ndrop the rule from the strict copy, rename the command.\n\nThe doc now names the dependency. \"Run them with the matching guide change\"\nwas true but quiet: strict parity is byte equality, so running the parity\nleg against Brain main before #605 lands fails on this repository's own\ncorrection, not on a regression.\n\nDropped nothing from the PR.\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -4 | cat && git status --short && echo \"(clean)\"","description":"Commit the 392 fix"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"1c4981f0-ed5b-4cad-a843-84bbc86ee2f4","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgqoQvLGTLSPD4a3f5Jaw","requestRef":"c8b6e77c-6f61-4ccf-9fb5-2db06a3a3921","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"79511c1e-87da-4e92-858e-c8f05666fd6d","timestamp":"2026-11-08T16:47:14.016Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"323e0f71-94c9-40df-877e-b0c11113f22d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
